@startuml arch-schedule
!include _style.iuml
title Schedule — arhitectură

actor "Studenți\nși profesori" as U
actor "Administratori\nde facultate" as ADM
cloud "**Google Workspace**\nOAuth (administrare)" as G

rectangle "**Aplicație web**\nVue 3 + Vuetify + TypeScript\nclient API generat din OpenAPI" as FE <<app>>
rectangle "**API Laravel 12**\nREST · OpenAPI / Swagger\nlimitare de rată" as API <<app>>
database "MySQL ×9\n(câte o bază pe facultate)" as DB

rectangle "**ULBS Connect**\nprezență, orar" as CON <<app>>
rectangle "**Plata cu ora**\norar profesori" as PO <<app>>
rectangle "**aSc Timetables**\nimport XML" as ASC <<external>>
rectangle "**Stat de funcții**\nimport Excel" as STAT <<external>>

U --> FE : orar public
ADM --> FE
FE --> API : REST
API --> DB : alege baza după\ncodul facultății
CON --> API : token
PO --> API : token
API <-- ASC
API <-- STAT
FE .[#4285F4].> G
@enduml
